  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science Conference - Berlin Process 2025 - ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Science Conference is an annual event of the Berlin Process. Its purpose is to foster discussion and co-operation on the challenges and possible solutions for the national science and education systems of the Western Balkans. The conference brings together key national stakeholders comprising national academies of sciences and arts, national rectors&#x2019; conferences, leading universities, and research organisations, as well as distinguished scientists, researchers and experts.</narrative>
  </description>
